    "method": "Looks at fixed cumulative pair counts; the level of each look is spent along an O'Brien-Fleming-type Lan-DeMets function over the planned looks (commander_lab.engine.rules.full_game_comparison.sequential_look_alphas), so repeated looking keeps the overall level. Cluster-robust Student-t interval of the paired win-credit differences (one cluster per seed, cluster_difference_stats); a look decides when that interval at the look's level lies entirely above the threshold (difference greater) or entirely at or below it (not greater). A zero-spread look (no variation between the seed clusters) decides only through the exact sign test on the discordant seeds at the look's level: the seat rotations of one seed share one library shuffle, so the seed, not the pair, is the independent unit. Failed games censor their pair and never count as a loss."
